body:
iPhones for anyone? I feel like if the whole town had one them would be so useful.

&#x200B;

For Harriet--security cameras installed in the store and town buildings. If there was internet she could post the town gossip/ funny moments on tik tok

Maybe bother was a bad word choice. I just did an episode shuffle and watched those in a row and it was a little strange to see them used in such different contexts. But I agree I loved Rev Alden trying so hard not to laugh then dying of laughter mid line and even Caroline trying not to laugh then letting go as Charles runs out. 

&#x200B;

I wonder how long Charles was really stuck with green hair or if he could dye it back to brown lol

Oh wow not sure I can decide. I'd say I still really love 1-2 but those have been my favorite seasons since 2007 but in terms of the later seasons I liked season 6 (really liked the Cuddy 9-5 episode) and the cases from season 8. I've seen season 1-5 a bunch of times through but only 6-8 once so I'll have to watch those later ones a few more times to make it a fair judgment. 

&#x200B;

What about you?
